{"agent_id":"pp3g-w9QQ-relaunch-of-440-extension-predecessor-frozen-pre-8314","agent_seq":7,"timestamp":"2026-08-24T02:02:07.223095514Z","event":{"type":"CommentAdded","issue_uuid":"c3edf981-9b48-48fe-a238-3fba92ac1cf2","comment_uuid":"e825814a-2f35-4c38-a9ab-3c85d28c9e0e","author":"pp3g-w9QQ-relaunch-of-440-extension-predecessor-frozen-pre-8314","content":"Result: Hookability Matrix extended per #440 — committed 289ecb04 on feature/pp3g-w9QQ-relaunch-of-440-extension-predecessor-frozen-pre-8314 (docs/research/registry/Hookability-Matrix.md only; 120+/52-). [#440]\n\n## ROWS CHANGED (re-validation, per #425 evidence)\n- ALL OpenCode-plugin enforcement rows re-classified [S2]-only with inline tags + consolidated per-row surface table: orchestrator write blocking (#1), push/merge/commit blocks+gates (#2-5), comment discipline (#6-9), RTK (#10). S1 validity for all ten: NOT ENFORCED.\n- Infrastructure table rebuilt: 3 plugins tagged [S2]; + liveness-watchdog.sh v2 (tmux, 120s cycle, verdict-diff flags to #429); + claude wrapper strict model validation; kickoff-notify timer detail corrected to 15s cadence w/ full stall-threshold mechanics (900s floor scaled by timeout/2, x2 debounce, 300s grace, overrun fallback).\n- §3 rows re-classified: '--model MUST be included' upgraded from Could-build to PARTIAL HOOK (claude wrapper FATAL-exits on missing/opus/sonnet/haiku — discovered during #440); catalog verification confirmed as real gap (wrapper accepts any non-Anthropic string).\n- §1/§9/§10/§13 enforced rows annotated; §6.4 watcher rows marked surface-independent.\n- Summary count 12→13 (added claude-wrapper model validation as #13); last_reviewed → 2026-08-24.\n\n## ROWS NEW (§14 Doctrine Additions, 2026-08-23/24 batch)\n1. fetch-method-selection — Yes/(a); #439 three-state guard DESIGN ONLY, would be [S2]-only.\n2. git push-cadence — Partial/(a)+(e); hard block exists [S2], cadence timing semantic, #438 popup DESIGN ONLY.\n3. task-length atomization (>~45m sequential = decompose) — Partial/(c)+(d); ASSESSED vs existing tooling: kickoff-notify.py does stall/overrun DETECTION at 15s cadence but nothing does dispatch-time decomposition enforcement — gap is preventive, not detective.\n4. never-assume-model — Partial/(d)+(c); PARTIAL HOOK already live in claude wrapper; catalog-check buildable in same wrapper.\n5. quota-parking failure class — Yes/(d); AI_APICallError 'Resource exhausted'/429 signatures VERIFIED present in ~/.local/share/opencode/log/opencode.log; NEITHER watcher parses it — no detector exists; watchdog v3 integration candidate.\n\n## V2 DIVERGENCES FOUND\n- S1 opencode2 beta loads global-fallback plugins (plugin.ts, interrupt.ts) ONLY — worktree crosslink-guard/orchestrator-guard/rtk-guard absent from v2 debug config; guard BLOCK/ALLOW logs prove S2 loading.\n- v2 permission model is action/resource/effect vs S2 permission/pattern Wildcard; filesystem_* frontmatter keys silently ignored on S1 (filesystem access routes through execute sandbox).\n- Net effect: effective structural enforcement on S1 = 3 mechanisms (heartbeat, systemd watcher, claude wrapper), not 13.\n- Bonus S2-side gap (#425): orchestrator-guard BLOCKED_TOOLS omits filesystem_create_directory/move_file.\n\n## TOP-3 HOOK PRIORITIES (given tonight's failures: ox-alpha freezes ×3 flavors, WebFetch-ingestion freezes #429/#423, quota-parked agents)\n1. Quota-parking PARKED-RETRYING detector — extend liveness-watchdog.sh v3 to parse opencode.log quota signatures; (d), LOW effort, channel already live.\n2. Fetch-method three-state WebFetch guard (#439) — tool.execute.before sequence counter; (a), LOW-MED, design exists.\n3. Never-assume-model catalog verify — one 'opencode models' subprocess check added to claude wrapper; (d), LOW effort.\n\nWHAT-NOT-TESTED: classifications are source/config/log inspection + issue evidence; no live probe of S1 plugin loading was re-run (relies on #425's empirical record); quota-parking detector design not prototyped; #442/#441 intentionally deferred per scope addendum.","created_at":"2026-08-24T02:02:07.214999305Z","kind":"result","signed_by":"SHA256:znJhnzsGjJE8OsqcZSlW4MWHnYfWCqBlArizceyD9cA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoWem7Za0H9kyGKyj1qXf+iYhoVGikz5l5R/KA4HkOioAAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABA/rqUO87n/YDwm+f1xDsPS+lDl3ZDv7NhSiJAfU0gQLepaEDb0mRvtZWPqfIj55NFoeTljxANzudoGOKD10DFDQ=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:znJhnzsGjJE8OsqcZSlW4MWHnYfWCqBlArizceyD9cA","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgoWem7Za0H9kyGKyj1qXf+iYhoVGikz5l5R/KA4HkOioAAAAPY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWV2ZW50AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLBxjFix5XYMHptDjaZ90TLR2uioXzwIdXYnXtfZPm7/JESW6/L6H1w9UVaQwL24ItCLc4llfh8XW+3HLiuJGQ4="}
